/-!
# Native M23 local conjugation actions

The quintet stabilizer modulo its intrinsic two-core is the genuine ΓL₂(4),
acting naturally on the core through its two systematic F₄ coordinates.
The heptad stabilizer modulo its intrinsic two-core is A7, and its
four-dimensional binary conjugation module is irreducible. Both actions
retain the actual point embedding and the native source markings.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith H.14.2(2–3), printed p.397.
-/
